<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoteu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Prota Epistolã Cãtrã Timoteu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">Prota Epistolã Cãtrã Timoteu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Pavlul, apostul al Isus Hristos, cu dimãndãciunea al Dumnidzãu, Ascãpãtorlu a nostru, sh-al Domnu Isus Hristos, tsi easti nãdia a noastrã, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />al Timoteu, hiljilu a meu alihios tu pisti:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 1:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Har, njilã sh-pace di la Dumnidzãlu Tatãl a nostru sh-di la Isus Hristos, Domnul a nostru.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoteu Prindi s-Ncuntreadzã Nvitsãtorlji Atselji Arãdioshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ashã cum ti pãrãcãlsii cãndu mi nchisii cãtrã Machidunii, shedz tu Efes sh-dimãndã niscãntsã oaminji tsi s-nu nveatsã ma nvitsãturi arãdioasi, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />s-nu ascultã mituluyii sh-ghenealoghii tsi nu au bitisiri, tsi facã ncãceari ma multu dicãt nãintarea a faptilor a Dumnidzãlui sh-tsi s-andoapir tu pisti. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Nãetea aishtei Dimãndãciunji easti vrearea di-la unã inimã curatã, di-la unã conshtintsã chischinã sh-di-la unã pisti fãrã ipucrizii. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Niscãntsã, cara s-dipãrtarã di aesti lucri, s-turnarã la zboari goali. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Elji vor s-hibã nvitsãtori a legiljei, ma nu aduchescu nitsi atseali tsi dzãc, nitsi atseali tsi spun cu sigurantsã. <verse eid="1TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Sh-noi shtim cã legea easti bunã, macã omlu u ufiliseashti cum prindi. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Noi shtim, cã legea nu easti faptã ti ndreptul, ma ti atselji tsi ncalcã legea, trã-rebiljilji, trã atselji fãrã-dumnidzã, trã amãrtioshlji, trã nisãmtsãlji sh-lãvoshilji, trã atselji tsi vatãmã tatãl sh-muma, trã vãtãmãtorlji, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />trã curvarlji, trã homosexualjlji, trã arãchitorlji a oaminjlor, trã arãditorilji, trã atselji tsi ncalcã spigiurarea, sh-trã caitsido altu tsi easti contra a nvitsãturãljei atsiljei sãnãtoasã. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Aestã nvitsãturã easti dupã Evanghelul a mãririljei a ghinicuvintatlui Dumnidzã tsi nji si pistipsi a njia.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Harul al Domnu ti Pavlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mini hãristisescu Hristolu Isus Domnul a nostru, tsi nji deadi fuchii, cã mi aflã axiu trã pistipsiri, sh-mi bãgã tu lucru. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Cu tutã cã cama nãinti earam blãstimãtor, avinãtor sh-tiran, Dumnidzãlu nji deadi njilã, cã li fãtseam di nishtirea sh-nipistipsirea a mea. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Harea a Domnului a nostru nji si deadi cu artirsiri deadun cu pistipsirea sh-vrearea tu Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Aestu zbor easti pistipsit sh-axiu ti aprucheari didip: Hristolu Isus vini tu lumi ti ascãpari amãrtioshlji, di la cai mini escu protlu. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Trã atsea mi njiluii mini ca protlu a amãrtioshilor, tsi Isus Hristolu s-aspunã ma nãinti tu mini tutã arãvdarea a lui, tsi s-earam ca urnechi trã atselji tsi va s-pistipseascã tu nãsu trã bana eternã. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Trã atsea a Amirãlui eternu, nimuritlu, nividzutlu, singurlu Dumnidzã, s-lji hibã tinjii sh-mãriri tu eta a etilor! Amin.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lucrul al Timoteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Ma ts-u pistipsescu aestã Dimãndãciunji, hiljiu a meu Timote, dupã prufitipsirili tsi s-featsirã ma nãinti trã tini, tsi dupã atseali s-fatsã alumta atsea buna, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />tsãnãnda pistea sh-unã conshtintsã bunã. Niscãntsã alipidãnda, cãdzurã di pistea a lor. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Di aeshti suntu Imeneu sh-Alexandrul, tsi mini lji pridedu tu mãnjili a Satanlui tsi s-nveatsã s-nu blastimã.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dimãndãciunjili trã Pãrãcãlsiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Tsã fac rigeai nãinti di tuti, si s-facã spigiurari, rugãciunji, interviniri sh-hãristisiri trã tuts oaminjlji, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />trã amiradzlji sh-trã tuts atselji cai suntu tu puteari, tra s-putem s-tritsem unã banã arihãtipsitã sh-tu pace cu itsi dumnidzãsiri sh-tinjii. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Aestã easti bunã sh-arsitã nãintea al Dumnidzãu, Ascãpãtorlu a nostru. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Elu va tsi tuts oaminjlji si ascapã shi s-agiungã la cunushtearea a alihiljei. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Un easti Dumnidzãlu, sh-un singur easti misitlu ntrã Dumnidzãlu sh-oaminjlji: Hristolu Isus om, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />tsi deadi bana ca arãscumpãrari trã tuts, ca mãrtirii tu chirolu tsi prindi. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Trã atsea mini mi bãgarã predicãtor sh-apostul – dzãc alihea, nu arãd – nvitsãtor la pãngãnjlji tu pisti sh-tu alihea. <verse eid="1TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Voi, tsi bãrbatslji s-pãrãcãlsescã iutsido, sculãnda mãnjili atseali curati, fãrã nãriri sh-fãrã ngrãnji. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Tutashã, voi tsi sh-muljerili si nveascã cu simplitati, cu tãpinii sh-cu tinjii, sh-nu cu cusitsi sh-cu furii, cu mãrgãritãri sh-cu stranji scumpi, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />ma cu fapti buni, cum lã-au hari a muljerilor tsi suntu spigiurati la Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Muljearea s-nveatsã tu tãtseari, sh-cu sumbãgari trã tuti. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Mini nu u alasã muljearea tsi s-nveatsã, sh-nitsi s-aibã autoritati pristi bãrbatlu, ma si sta tãcutã. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Cã ma nãinti s-featsi Adamlu, sh-deapoea Eva. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Sh-nu s-arãsi Adamlu, ma muljearea s-arãsi sh-cãdzu tu amãrtii. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Cu tutã atsea ea va si-ascapã prit amintarea a cilimenjilor, macã ea va armãnã tu pisti, tu vreari sh-tu sãmtsãsiri cu tãpinii.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Aestu zbor easti pistipsit: Macã vãrã va si s-facã episcop, lucru bun va. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Lipseashti tsi episcoplu s-hibã fãrã cusuri, bãrbat a unei singur muljeari, mintimen, misurat, rispectat, oaspitor, cãdãr s-nveatsã sh-altsã, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />s-nu hibã datã dupã yinlu, s-nu hibã violent, ma s-hibã arãvdãtor, s-nu hibã gindãvos, s-nu hibã tãmãchear a pãradzilor. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Elu prindi s-hibã om tsi u nicuchireashti ghini casa a lui sh-prindi s-aibã cilimenjlji ursits sh-cu multu rispect. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Cã macã vãrã nu shtii s-nicuchireascã casa a lui, cum va s-aibã cãshtigã ti bisearica a Dumnidzãlui? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Episcoplu s-nu hibã macãt-turnat tu pisti, tra s-nu lji creascã mintea shi s-cadã tu pozita a cãtãdzicãsiriljei a draclui. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Elu prindi s-aibã mãrtirii bunã di la atselji di nafoarã, tsi s-nu cadã tu arushinari shi s-nu s-acatsã tu laclu a draclui.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Tutashã diaconjlji prindi s-hibã cu tinjii, nu cu doauã fãts, s-nu si s-da dupã multu yin, s-nu hibã tãmãchear di amintatic ni-ndreptu. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Elji prindi s-tsãnã cu conshtintsã curatã mistiryiul a pistiljei. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Aeshti si s-bãgã ma nãinti tu provã, deapoea s-facã huzmitipsirea a lor macã suntu fãrã cusuri. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Muljerili a lor s-hibã tinjisiti, nu munafitsi, ma misurati sh-pistimenji tu itsido. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Diaconjlji s-hibã bãrbatslji a unei singur muljeari, s-lã nicuchireascã ghini cilimenjlji sh-alants oaminji ali fumealji. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Cã atselji tsi au faptã ghini diaconia, amintã numã bunã shi mari sigurantsã tu pistea al Isus Hristos.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ma ts-li scriu aesti lucri cã am nãdii cã va yinã trãoarã la tini, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ma, ma mi amãnai, sã shtii cã cum oaminjlji prindi si s-poartã tu casa al Dumnidzãu, cã voi crishtinjlji hits bisearica a Dumnidzãlui atsilui yiulu, coloana shi timeljiu a alihiljei. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Shi fãrã shubei cã mistiryiul a pistiljei easti mari:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Hristolu s-fãnirusi tu trup,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">s-ndriptã tu Duh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">s-aspusi la anghilji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">s-ghinihãbãrsi la pãngãnjlji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">s-pistipsi tu lumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">s-anãltsã tu mãriri.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dimãndãciunjili al Timoteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Duhlu dzãtsi curat, cã tu chirolu di soni niscãntsã va u aleapidã pistea, sh-va urmeadzã duhurili arãdioasi shi nvitsãturili a demonjilor. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Atselji nveatsã arãdearili cu ipucrizii, sh-au conshtintsã moartã, sh-arsã cu her ardios. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Elji va curmu nsurarea shi va s-vã urseascã s-nu mãcats niscãnti di mãcãrili tsi Dumnidzãlu adrã si s-ljea cu hãristisiri di atselji tsi pistipsescu shi l-cunoscu alihea. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Cã itsi fãpturã a Dumnidzãlui easti bunã sh-tsiva nu easti ti arucari, macã s-ljea cu hãristisiri, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />cã easti sãmtsãsitã prit zborlu a Dumnidzãlui sh-prit pãrãcãlsirea. <verse eid="1TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Macã lã-li nvetsi aesti lucri a fratsilor sh-a surãrilor, tini va s-hii un huzmichear bun al Isus Hristos, hrãnit cu zboarili a pistiljei sh-a nvitsãturãljei atsiljei buni, tsi urmeshti. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Dipãrteadzã-ti di pãrãvuliili zurliti sh-prufani, shi nveatsã-ti tu dumnidzãsiri, <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />cã talimea a truplui easti ti putsãn chiro axiu, ma dumnidzãsirea easti axiu ti itsido, cã ari tãxirea a banãljei di tora sh-atsiljei tsi va yinã. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Aestu zbor easti pistipsit sh-axiu di aprucheari didip. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Trã-aestã, noi ma lucrãm multu shi alumtãm, cã avem nãdãit la Dumnidzãlu atsel yiulu, tsi easti Ascãpãtorlu a tuts oaminjlor, sh-ma multu a pistimenjilor. <verse eid="1TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ursea aesti shi nveatsã-li aesti lucri. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Vãrã s-nu u atimuseascã tinireatsa a ta atsea noaua, ma fã-ti exemplu di pistimenji tu zbor, tu purtari, tu vreari, tu pisti sh-tu chischineatsã. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Bagã mintea la ghivãsirea discljisã a Scrituriljei, la urnipsirea shi la nvitsãturã pãnã s-yinã mini. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Nu alasã dupã mãnã doara tsi ts-easti datã prit prufitipsiri, cu bãgarea a mãnjilor pri tini di-la aushlji. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Minduia-ti di aesti shi s-armãnji didip tu aesti, tsi nãintarea a ta s-hibã vidzut di tuts. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Afirea-ti tini sh-nvitsãtura a ta, veaglji aesti lucri, cã, fãcãnda ashãtsi, va s-ascachi bana a ta shi atselji tsi ti ascultã.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Veduvili, Aushlji shi Sclayilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Nu vãrghea cu aspru un aush, ma urnipsea-lu ca tatãli a tãu, sh-ma tinirlji ca frats, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />moashili ca muma, fetili ca surãri cu chischineatsã. <verse eid="1TI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Tinjisea veduvili tsi suntu tu ananghi. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Macã unã veduvã ari ficiori sh-nipots, aeshti s-nveatsã ma nãinti sã spunã dumnidzãsirea cãtrã atselji di casa a lor shi s-tinjiseascã pãrintsãlji a lor, cã aestã easti arsitã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Shi atsea tsi easti dealihea veduvã sh-ari armasã singur, nãdãeashti la Dumnidzãlu shi armãni tu spigiurari shi tu rugãciunji noapti sh-dzuã. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Iarã atsea tsi bãneadzã nifãrnat, cu tutã cã bãneadzã, easti moartã. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Dimãndã-lã sh-aesti, tsi nitsiunã s-nu hibã cu cusuri. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Macã vãrã nu s-cãshtigheadzi di oaminjlji a lui, sh-ma multu di atselji a casãljei a lui, elu u ari alipidat pistea shi easti ma arãu di un nipistimen. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Unã veduvã si s-registreadzã tu lista a veduvilor, ma s-hibã nu ma noauã di shaidzãtsi di anji, shi s-aibã avutã un singur bãrbat. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Ea s-aibã mãrtirii trã fapti buni, tsi ari criscutã cilimenjlji a ljei, ari ashtiptatã xenjilji, ari aspilatã cicioarili a sãmtsãlor, ari agiutat niavutslji, shi easti puituitã dipriunã cu itsido lucru bunã. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Ma nu aproachi veduvili ma nali, cã, cãndu va si s-da dupã vrearili a lor, va s-arniseascã Hristolu sh-va caftã si s-mãritã. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Deapoea ljea pri nãsi giudicata, cã au ncãlcat pistea di prota. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Meti eali si nveatsã s-hibã timbeli imnãnda casã di casã, sh-nu mash timbeli, ma sh-dãrdãroasi zburãnda digeaba. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Trã atsea, voi tsi veduvili atseali nali si s-mãritã, s-aibã cilimenji, si s-facã nicuchiri a cãsilor shi s-nu da a contrarlui vãrã itii trã greari ti arãu, <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />cã niscãnti tora s-turnarã s-urmeadzã Satanlu. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Macã vãrã pistimen ari veduvi trã cãshtigari, s-li agiutã shi s-nu si facã sartsinã a bisearicãljei, tsi bisearica s-poatã s-agiutã atseli tsi suntu tu ananghi. <verse eid="1TI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Aushlji tsi chiverniseascã ghini lucrili a bisearicãljei, si s-tinjiseascã di doauã ori, ma multu atselji tsi s-apustusescu cu predicari sh-cu nvitsari. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Cã Scritura dzãtsi: “Nu lji leagã gura a boului cãndu alunseashti tu grãnar,” shi: “Lucrutorlu u ari cu dhichi plata a lui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Deut 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luc 10:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Nu aproachi nitsi unã acuzã contra un aush, mash cãndu ari doi icã trei martiri. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Iarã atselji tsi amãrtiseascã vãrghea-lji nãintea a tutulor, tsi sh-alantsãlji s-au fricã. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Mini ti spigiurã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, al Hristos Isus sh-a anghiljilor atsilor aleptsã, tsi s-li fatsã aesti Dimãndãciunji fãrã pri-giudicari, shi nu fã tsiva cu hãtãri. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Nu aĝunjiseati s-badzã mãnjili la varã tsi su numeshti trã huzmitipsiri shi nu ti fã urtac tu amãrtiili altsilor. Veaglji-ti chischin! <verse eid="1TI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Nu bea mash apã, ma ljea putsãn yin di stomaclu a tãu sh-di lãngoarili a tali atseli multi. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />La niscãntsã oaminji amãrtiili s-veadã lishor sh-imnã nãintea a lor tu giudicatã, iarã la altsã s-veadã ma napoi. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Tutashã, sh-faptili atseali buni s-ved, ma sh-atseali tsi suntu nividzuti nu pot s-armãnã ascumti.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Tuts tsi suntu sum giuglu a sclãviiljei si lji lugurseascã nicuchirlji a lor axii ti itsi tinjii, tsi numa a Dumnidzãlui sh-nvitsãtura a noastrã nu si s-ngiurã. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Shi atselji tsi li au nicuchirlji pistimenji, s-nu lji atimuseascã cã suntu frats, ma s-lã huzmitipseascã sh-ma ghini, cã atselji tsi au hãiri di lucrul a lor suntu pistimenji sh-vruts.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Nvitsãtori Arãdioshi sh-Vrearea trã Pãradz</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Nveats-lã aeasti lucri sh-dimãndã-lã. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Macã vãrã nveatsã unã nvitsãturã altã shi nu ascultã zboarili atseali sãnãtoasi a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos sh-nvitsãtura dupã dumnidzãsirea, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />elu easti fudul shi nu shtii tsiva. Elji va ma multu debatsili shi ncãcearili cu zboari, di-la cai s-amintã zilia, ncãcearea, ngiurãrili, shubeili atseli arãli, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />debatsili di geaba a oaminjlor cu minti asparti shi guliti di alihea, tsi mindueascã cã dumnidzãsirea easti trã amintari. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ma dumnidzãsirea adutsi un mari amintatic, macã omlu s-hãrseashti cu atsea tsi ari. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Cã noi nu avem adus tsiva tu aestã dunjauã, sh-nu va-lom tsiva cu noi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Macã avem s-mãcãm shi s-nã nvishtem, s-himã hãristisitã cu aestã. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ma atselji tsi vor si s-facã avuts, cad tu cãrteari, tu cearc sh-tu multi orixi niminduiti sh-zãrãsiti, tsi li afundusescu oaminjlji tu cãdeari sh-aspãrdzeari. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Cã vrearea di pãradzi easti rãdãtsina a tut arãlilor, shi avãnda orixi multã, niscãntsi s-dipãrtarã di pisti sh-pãtsãrã multi dureari.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dimãndãciunjili di Soni Cãtrã Timoteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ma tini, omlu a Dumnidzãlui, dipãrteadzã-ti di aesti sh-urmeadzã ndriptatea, dumnidzãsirea, pistea, vrearea, arãvdarea shi muljeatsa-a-inimãljei. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Alumtã-ti trã alumta atsea buna a pistiljei. Ambratsãsea bana eternã, tu cai ti acljimarã sh-trã cai ai datã bunã mãrtirii trã pistea nãintea a mults martirii. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ma ti spigiurã nãinti a Dumnidzãlui, cai da banã a tutulor shi nãinti a Hristolui Isus, tsi deadi unã mãrtirii bunã nãintea al Pontius Pilat, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />s-lu veaglji aestã Dimãndãciunji fãrã damcã sh-cusuri, pãnã cãndu s-aspunã Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Elu tu chirolu tsi lipseashti va si s-aspunã di Dumnidzãlu, ghinicuvintatlu shi singurlu Domnitor, Amirãlu a amirãrilor shi Domnul a domnilor. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Elu singur u ari nimurirea shi sta tu lunjinã niaprucheatã, tsi nitsiun nu u ari vidzutã pute shi nu poati s-u veadã. Atsilui s-lji hibã tinjia shi putearea eternã! Amin.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Dimãndã-lã avutslji a lumiljei aishtei s-nu hibã pirifanj, shi s-nu nãdãeascã la ayishtearea tsi easti nisigur, ma tu Dumnidzãlu, tsi nã da cu multeatsã itsido s-nã hãrseascã. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Dimãndã s-facã ghinetsi, si s-facã avuts cu fapti buni, s-hibã giumertsã sh-etinji trã dari, <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />adunãnda ca ayishteari un bun timeljiu trã yinitura, tsi s-agiundzemu bana alihioasã.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timote, veaglji atsea tsi tsã s-ari pistipsitã, firinda di zboarili atseali di geaba sh-lumeshti sh-di cuntrãrili atsiljei tsi cu nindriptati s-acljeami shtiintsã, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />tsi lu ambrãtsisirã niscãntsi shi ishirã di pisti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Harul s-hibã cu voi!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>